oWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22Exti_Isr.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KKRv9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D\" hindent=\"2em\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"Rkf7a\" id=\"Rkf7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ad8cce3\" id=\"u7ad8cce3\">外部中断测试</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"OAyPj\" id=\"OAyPj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f8bc564\" id=\"u8f8bc564\">测试外部中断0</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uf9818d14\" id=\"uf9818d14\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3932000c\" id=\"u3932000c\">测试上升沿和下降沿中断</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua28b4ed3\" id=\"ua28b4ed3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud702069a\" id=\"ud702069a\">初始化</span><code data-lake-id=\"u09ce09fd\" id=\"u09ce09fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ba3097c\" id=\"u1ba3097c\">EXT_INT0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6a833456\" id=\"u6a833456\">，并将</span><code data-lake-id=\"u50a001a2\" id=\"u50a001a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1023052\" id=\"uc1023052\">P32</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u30900a3b\" id=\"u30900a3b\">设置为准双向或HighZ高阻输入模式（不设置默认也是HighZ）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud855f9c6\" id=\"ud855f9c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e6fad4b\" id=\"u7e6fad4b\">按下核心板上的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u40e94b7e\" id=\"u40e94b7e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u163fe3fb\" id=\"u163fe3fb\">P32</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u42da33ec\" id=\"u42da33ec\">按钮，编写中断函数，观察上升沿和下降沿对应日志</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"NwaRD\" id=\"NwaRD\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bd3ce45\" id=\"u6bd3ce45\">测试外部中断2、3或者4</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u056dff97\" id=\"u056dff97\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54511a78\" id=\"u54511a78\">案例设置：</span></p><ul list=\"uaadc7add\"><li fid=\"u6db73698\" data-lake-id=\"u5bc678d9\" id=\"u5bc678d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50a634bb\" id=\"u50a634bb\">准备一个引脚（例如P53暂且叫做A引脚），初始化时为输出模式，并且为低电</span></li><li fid=\"u6db73698\" data-lake-id=\"u9dcd6dc0\" id=\"u9dcd6dc0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u478620ef\" id=\"u478620ef\">初始化中断引脚P3.6或者P3.7（暂且叫做B引脚），配置为下降沿触发，并且实现中断事件函数</span></li><li fid=\"u6db73698\" data-lake-id=\"udf2837e6\" id=\"udf2837e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b68b32b\" id=\"u0b68b32b\">通过杜邦线将A引脚和B引脚连接</span></li><li fid=\"u6db73698\" data-lake-id=\"u254408af\" id=\"u254408af\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe9440c1\" id=\"ufe9440c1\">准备串口，通过串口工具给串口发送指令</span></li><li fid=\"u6db73698\" data-lake-id=\"ufcaee3d0\" id=\"ufcaee3d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafab2d1d\" id=\"uafab2d1d\">串口接收到特定指令时，将A引脚拉高或拉低</span></li><li fid=\"u6db73698\" data-lake-id=\"u72855380\" id=\"u72855380\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37195d17\" id=\"u37195d17\">在中断事件函数中进行打印，观察打印结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u14253245\" id=\"u14253245\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca05209b\" id=\"uca05209b\">测试上升沿案例会发现无效，这个由芯片内部决定的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2fd263aa\" id=\"u2fd263aa\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"VpAsq\" id=\"VpAsq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97a94b29\" id=\"u97a94b29\">PCB中断设计</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8f2372b4\" id=\"u8f2372b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd6fbd11\" id=\"ucd6fbd11\">要了解的一些情况：</span></p><ol list=\"ud357d889\"><li fid=\"uadf2cd87\" data-lake-id=\"u724fec4d\" id=\"u724fec4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef734d7a\" id=\"uef734d7a\">芯片引脚支持触发类型，是上升沿触发还是下降沿触发。</span></li><li fid=\"uadf2cd87\" data-lake-id=\"ufd1907f9\" id=\"ufd1907f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf5e9780\" id=\"ucf5e9780\">外部中断发送者是否是可控的，是不是能控制高低电平。</span></li></ol><ol list=\"ud357d889\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uadf2cd87\" data-lake-id=\"u25115e7d\" id=\"u25115e7d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b4e2f40\" id=\"u6b4e2f40\">能控制最好，芯片方的引脚只需要关注是不是外部中断引脚。</span></li><li fid=\"uadf2cd87\" data-lake-id=\"u621330d3\" id=\"u621330d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua50214fb\" id=\"ua50214fb\">不能控制，要了解对方的触发方式，寻找芯片对应的触发类型引脚。</span></li><li fid=\"uadf2cd87\" data-lake-id=\"udb35caa5\" id=\"udb35caa5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04b1ede6\" id=\"u04b1ede6\">不能控制，芯片的外部中断引脚没有对应的触发方式了，电路设计时，做上拉或者下拉电阻。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uaca03bc7\" id=\"uaca03bc7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u70e1219f\" id=\"u70e1219f\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"RurT3\" id=\"RurT3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa08341c\" id=\"uaa08341c\">练习题</span></h2><ol list=\"ua03fb839\"><li fid=\"u76e5591a\" data-lake-id=\"u64c480dc\" id=\"u64c480dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda44cf83\" id=\"uda44cf83\">模拟外部中断触发上升沿，通过串口进行中断事件触发打印</span></li><li fid=\"u76e5591a\" data-lake-id=\"u7f04bede\" id=\"u7f04bede\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19ed67b3\" id=\"u19ed67b3\">模拟外部中断触发下降沿，通过串口进行中断事件触发打印</span></li></ol>",
